.png", "id": "218005225926147", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974452_2201383159907459_5287118399372001280_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VdULbPS9WygQ7kNvwGRNYJp&_nc_oc=Ado8xGasQ9Grze4-MEi2jy39V3hvv7uQRUX6TfOq0wskCll69pRbEbmNarTom9v3tH0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQX_6PJ_vw5DyzbYrTsRKnJlsmtUNV3o3P3t4F1matSFkg&oe=6B0F16CD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/C1xhyB", "id": "397817811059688", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974529_397817817726354_5123164521132720128_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W3wpY2mM4IAQ7kNvwEHodtP&_nc_oc=AdoZmAIx79roEfw7ES8UXYkk3yGdMWzMCVTiIpIQWlQOFGso_ZGWwvNxRNXr-w4ITRw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXMIlAaW1GwP0j5vPr_5Bp8XkT7nD3O-4pBytpvitBqZg&oe=6B0F1789"}, "display_name": "Ultrawings", "keywords": ["Ultrawings", "simulation", "aircraft", "flight", "flying"], "long_description": "In Ultrawings, you'll pilot multiple aircraft using your virtual hands to interact with the flight stick and instruments to complete tons of missions while soaring around beautiful islands.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- Pilot 4 distinct aircraft each with their own handling characteristics!\n\n- Soar around 4 unique, beautifully-stylized islands!\n\n- Earn money to buy new airports and new vehicles! Ultrawings is a VR game with REAL progression!\n\n- Tons of gameplay variety! Pop balloons, participate in thrilling air races, fly through score rings, and even perform emergency landings! Ultrawings is the ultimate hobbyist flight game!\n\n- Full VO support guides you through the game!", "short_description": "Use your virtual hands to pilot the Ultralight, rocket-powered Glider, Sport Plane, and Gee Racer to complete a variety of missions across an island-themed world!"}]}, "developer_name": "Bit Planet Games, LLC", "devel